# Content workflows

When adding or changing kid-facing copy, drawings, photos, or content schemas, follow the declarative graphs in `/workflows`. Start with `workflows/content-authoring.example.yaml`.

- Nodes are developer/agent steps. Edges are file-path handoffs.
- License gate and human trace of SVG are human gates.
- Kid-facing copy and images require `kid-facing-copy-gate`. Do not auto-approve it.
- Cycles are capped (`cycleCap`). No unattended loops on child copy.
- These graphs are build-time only. Do not import `/workflows` from `src/`.
- Do not freeze `docs/candidates.md` into schema.
